# Edge of Existence (WotG 40) in Batallia Downs: the Cavernous Maw plays 3 [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]; its finish
# completes the mission (Her Memories current), then xi.maws.goToMaw gets the zone's id where it wants a maw table and
# raises "attempt to index local 'maw' (a number value)" (the step's expect-error): the char stays where it is.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/3
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg EdgeOfExistence current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # 3
finish expect-error "attempt to index local 'maw' (a number value)"
